{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883534-2e-hack-no-inferior-arcanum","id":883534,"title":"[2E] Hack - No Inferior Arcanum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-06T00:16:11-07:00","id":883534,"title":"[2E] Hack - No Inferior Arcanum","content":"It\u2019s very straight forward hack \u2013 it\u2019s described in the topic. For those that do not like that Acanthus cannot command Forces, Moros have always problems with Spirit or Obrimos cannot study Death ( poor Echo Walkers <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ). Topic for talking over implications of this hack.<br /> <br /> <b>I want only to point out that Inferior Arcanum <i>can</i> be learned by mages of particular Path</b> \u2013 only they need teacher of the Path that has this Arcanum as Ruling or Common. It\u2019s just much, much harder to learn for characters. My own one gaming group wanted this hack, but other did not, wanting to work as teachers to one another. Talk this through with players.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">No Inferior Arcanum Hack</span></b><ul><li>Previous Inferior Arcanum of Path becomes Common.</li> <li>Soul Stones cannot be made in to Annulities ( See <b>Tome of Mysteries</b> for more info ).</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-07T04:39:30-07:00","id":884545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883534-2e-hack-no-inferior-arcanum#post883534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It\u2019s very straight forward hack \u2013 it\u2019s described in the topic. For those that do not like that Acanthus cannot command Forces, Moros have always problems with Spirit or Obrimos cannot study Death ( poor Echo Walkers <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ). Topic for talking over implications of this hack.<br /> <br /> <b>I want only to point out that Inferior Arcanum <i>can</i> be learned by mages of particular Path</b> \u2013 only they need teacher of the Path that has this Arcanum as Ruling or Common. It\u2019s just much, much harder to learn for characters. My own one gaming group wanted this hack, but other did not, wanting to work as teachers to one another. Talk this through with players.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">No Inferior Arcanum Hack</span></b><ul><li>Previous Inferior Arcanum of Path becomes Common.</li> <li>Soul Stones cannot be made in to Annulities ( See <b>Tome of Mysteries</b> for more info ).</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>What do you mean &quot;Can not&quot;? They can not START with dots in it, but that's all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-07T10:24:18-07:00","id":884718,"title":"","content":"It's a solution. I admit I prefer &quot;you choose your inferior Arcanum and work out why it's a blind post in your magic&quot;. Notably because Annulities are awesome.<br /> l,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2225-ganonso","name":"ganonso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T14:14:18-07:00","id":925040,"title":"","content":"I think your 'hack' is actually how the rules are. By default, you can't <i>start</i> with dots in your inferior Arcanum, but in play you can take it up to 2 on your own, and only need a teacher to get beyond that point. Not only that, if you do then join a legacy which has it as a Ruling Arcanum, it becomes another Ruling Arcanum for you, thus giving you three Ruling Arcana and no Inferior Arcanum.<br /> <br /> Unless, of course, I've totally missed something about what you said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T16:34:26-07:00","id":925551,"title":"","content":"I don't think it tremendously changes things. For the most part, you lose some flavor, and you shave off a few necessary character interactions. I don't know what Annulities are, but they are a toolbox item, not core, so it doesn't matter very much. But Acanthus can command Forces already, Obrimos can study Death, etc, it's just that higher principles require much more guidance.<br /> <br /> Does anyone really care about Arcana being Inferior? It seems like such a trifle, you can keep them or drop them without radically affecting the game...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":969,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","user":"Verge","date":". 07-03-2016, 07:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T03:39:24-07:00","id":979575,"title":"","content":"Or that character can choose <i>any </i>non-Ruling to make, per each Annulities? Would that fly with idea?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}